# Collision prevention (shared/robot/guard.c rb_guard_watch, margin 10 mm):
# a line straight at a wall at up to ~95 mm/s. Every 1 ms the guard asks
# whether the arm could still stop (its own synchronised stop) without
# coming within the margin; it stops in time: the wrist never touches the
# wall (no contact force), the true clearance stays above ~5 mm, protective
# stop (off_reason 5). Without prevention the same line hits the wall.
@program arm/arm_sim
@args arm/arcmate/arcmate.arm
@include arm/tests/inc_wall.txt
mark
prevent 10
lmove 6 1100 0 1271 0 0 0
run 6.5
print prevent contact off clear
@expect arm.off_reason == 5
@expect arm.contact_max == 0
@expect arm.clear_min > 5
@expect arm.clear > 5
@expect arm.prev_body == 4
@reject ^ERROR
